 link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte#Her_Gift_of_Silver\" title=\"Acolyte\">Her Gift of Silver</a> to characters (including <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a>) with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/20px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/30px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/40px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acolyte\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/20px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\">Acolyte</a> background.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div 